    "chunk_text": "ridian. \u00dea hie tog\u00e6dereweard foran, \u00fea \u00feohton Eugenius & Arbogestes \u00fe\u00e6t hie sceoldon \u00e6rest of \u00fe\u00e6m & Theodosius h\u00e6fde \u00feone wind mid him \u00fe\u00e6t his fultum mehte m\u00e6stra \u00e6lcne heora flana on hiora \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Eugenius ofslagen, & Arbogastes ofstang hiene selfne. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Theodosius for on Italie. \u00dea he com to M\u00e6gelan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, \u00fea geendade he his lif, & betahte his tw\u00e6m sunum \u00feone \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & C & XLIX, feng Archadius to anwalde, to & for \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee hie geonge w\u00e6ron, he hie betahte his tw\u00e6m ealdormonnum to bewitanne: Ac hie gecy\u00f0don ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s hwelce hlafordhyldo hi \u00feohton to gecy\u00feanne on hiora ealdhlafordes & for \u00fe\u00e6m feondscipe he forlet Gotan on Italie mid hiora twam ciningum, Alrican & R\u00e6dgotan, Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s Alrica wear\u00f0 cristen; & R\u00e6dgota h\u00e6\u00feen \u00feurhwunade, & d\u00e6ghwamlice w\u00e6s blotende Nugiet eow Romane m\u00e6g gescomian, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, \u00fe\u00e6t ge swa heanlic ge\u00feoht sceoldon on eow Ge magon eac ge\u00feencan hu hean he eft wear\u00fe his geblota & his diofolgilda \u00fee he on gelifde, \u00fea \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s, swa swa ge selfe s\u00e6don, II C M, swa eower nan ne wear\u00f0 gewundod. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & C & IIII & siex",
